[**
 * The Swift file of a generator class.
 *
 * A class that is abstract, an interface, or extended by other classes is declared as a protocol that lists the
 * properties of its features. A class that has instances is also declared as a final class, because the runtime
 * requires model objects to be sendable. The final class keeps the values of its features in a structure that a
 * lock guards, offers a property for every feature it declares or inherits, and implements the reflective methods
 * of the runtime. A class that other classes extend has a final class whose name carries a suffix.
 **/]
[module Class('http://www.eclipse.org/emf/2002/GenModel', 'http://swift-modelling.org/typemapping/1.0')/]
